{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27&lt; add to wish list now~!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get back your child who was kidnapped by penguins! The Final Penguin has sent his crew of snake penguins to capture you. They won't be easy to catch... Use the special camera to intercept them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera-based puzzles have been powered up!<br>Use a variety of newly added gimmicks to make your way through the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of new tricks have been added?<br>Well, you'll have to check in to find out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Penguins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Snake Penguin isn\u2019t the only one after you.<br>Many penguins in this hotel have their eyes on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cast of unique penguins and an unpredictable story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not a Fan of Horror?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries!<br>The game is designed to be enjoyable even for those who aren\u2019t good with horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Series</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <i>Penguin Hotel 2</i>, the sequel to <i>Penguin Hotel 1</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend playing <i>Penguin Hotel 1</i> before jumping into 2.<br>But even if you've only watched a video or stream, you'll still have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 <i>(Of course, we'd love for you to buy it...)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Videoing and Distribution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlease include the title(Subtitle optional) of this game in the title of your video or stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAdd the Steam link to the description section of your video or stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other than the above, there are no specific requirements. Please use your best judgment and act responsibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome videos and streams to help more people discover this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Found the Penguin - 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369390/7b7ccd6b21c5b6bbd908a172fbb50a1adc690737.jpg"},{"name":"Found the Penguin - 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369390/1e14ffaab1423f480e1a79e18e5adb34b19dd619.jpg"},{"name":"Found the Penguin - 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369390/7d8b1421a81c6b2e6ffe4ed106a2620fc365203d.jpg"},{"name":"Found the Penguin - 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369390/a3ca562a1d67fe05fa3e66557ff643a555861b02.jpg"},{"name":"Panna cotta","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369390/2723f87622a476aabb66d46a6eba271cfc3fe494.jpg"},{"name":"(\u00b4\u30fb\u03c9\u30fb\uff40)?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369390/c688ce46c8e984df1fe0860e12006505031bb58a.jpg"},{"name":"Found all the Penguins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369390/d720063c1de38fac6d0fdcf4e86fe9f69f6f6b28.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369390?t=1745404760","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369390?t=1745404760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369390/5fb28927b56377a00082d406a2875309a4b300cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745404760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369390/5fb28927b56377a00082d406a2875309a4b300cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745404760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achiev